Hello world,
here we are, with a slight delay.
The 1.3.0 has been released with the following changes:

- Reviewed the whole english translation to fix the typos and improve the overall quality;
- Added the support for SteamDeck and Linux Distros;
- Added the window mode to the options menu;
- Fixed the initial cursor position of the save menu when the first slot should be preselected;
- Fixed the window horizontal align on the ultra-wide screens;
- Minor general fixes.

Thank you for your play.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42465501/bef97da1d6bc3c7f076c9f12fed85670d5960f30.jpg

Hi guys!
the v1.2.0 has been released with the following fixes and improvements:

- implemented up to 18 autosaves (checkpoints) in order to make more safe the player progress;
- reviewed all the skills to balance the statuses which resulted too much frequent;
- added the status prevention feature to several accessories;
- increased the opening time of some windows (e.g. choice window) in order to prevent a user unexpected selection;
- fixed a bug which hid two Tio arrow skills (ops!);
- Improved the UI of the save / load menu.

Thank you for your play!
